          "expression": "(length(id) > 0) AND (btrim(id) = id) AND (length(provider_id) > 0) AND (btrim(provider_id) = provider_id) AND (length(external_transaction_id) > 0) AND (btrim(external_transaction_id) = external_transaction_id) AND (length(idempotency_key) > 0) AND (btrim(idempotency_key) = idempotency_key) AND (length(payload_hash) > 0) AND (btrim(payload_hash) = payload_hash) AND (length(player_id) > 0) AND (btrim(player_id) = player_id) AND (length(round_id) > 0) AND (btrim(round_id) = round_id) AND (length(game_id) > 0) AND (btrim(game_id) = game_id)",
